## 4. Sprint 3 — Registration, Capacity & Waitlist

**Owner:** Sarthak Srivastava (Registration & Capacity). **Supporting:** Abhinash Ashish (Waitlist join flow).

| User Story | Tasks | Story Points |
| --- | --- | --- |
| As an attendee, I want to register for an event so that I can attend it. | Build registration flow; decrement SeatsRemaining on success | 5 |
| As the system, I want to block registration once an event is full so that capacity is never exceeded. | Add transactional check-and-decrement logic to prevent overbooking | 5 |
| As an attendee, I want to join a waitlist when an event is full so that I get a seat if one opens up. | Build Waitlist entity, join flow, FIFO ordering | 5 |

