## 5. Sprint 4 — Payment, Refund, Cancellation & Auto-Promotion

**Owner:** Aurko Chatterjee (Payment & Refund). **Supporting:** Abhinash Ashish (Cancellation & waitlist promotion).

| User Story | Tasks | Story Points |
| --- | --- | --- |
| As an attendee, I want to pay for a paid event so that my registration is confirmed. | Build mock PaymentService; Payment entity; Pending → Completed flow | 5 |
| As an attendee, I want a refund when I cancel a paid registration so that I get my money back. | Refund flow: Payment status → Refunded on cancellation | 3 |
| As an attendee, I want to cancel my registration so that I free up my seat. | Cancellation flow; free seat; trigger refund if applicable | 3 |
| As the system, I want to auto-promote the next waitlisted attendee when a seat opens so that seats don't go unused. | FIFO promotion logic triggered on cancellation | 5 |

