## 8. Definition of Done

- Feature matches its acceptance criteria from the requirement-analysis document
- Code builds without errors and is committed to the shared repository
- Feature has been manually tested by the owning member
- No breaking changes to modules delivered in prior sprints
- UI is functional and free of unhandled exceptions for the happy path
